WEBVTT

00:00:00.256 --> 00:00:04.685
In Administration, Setup and Install, verify the compatible ZTF

00:00:04.693 --> 00:00:09.216
one point x runtime. Framework status starts as Checking framework while

00:00:09.216 --> 00:00:13.833
detection runs. Installed framework files do not prove cluster health.

00:00:13.901 --> 00:00:18.159
Retained NKP or two point x binaries do not make their retired

00:00:18.167 --> 00:00:19.838
console execution available.

00:00:20.258 --> 00:00:23.365
Open Users, then Sessions as an administrator.

00:00:23.586 --> 00:00:27.938
Three signed-in users and five sessions can represent several sign-ins by

00:00:27.938 --> 00:00:32.299
the same account. Recently active means recorded interaction within five

00:00:32.350 --> 00:00:36.523
minutes; an unexpired session is not proof that a person is currently using

00:00:36.531 --> 00:00:40.832
the console. Review username, sign-in role and time, last

00:00:40.840 --> 00:00:45.266
activity and expiry. Passive polling does not itself prove activity,

00:00:45.380 --> 00:00:48.039
and activity does not extend expiry.

00:00:48.239 --> 00:00:52.676
To revoke one session, review its identifier and confirmation, then

00:00:52.676 --> 00:00:54.170
inspect the audit record.

00:00:54.400 --> 00:00:57.905
Do not confuse revocation with deleting the user account.

00:00:58.240 --> 00:01:02.080
Back up configuration and the matching database and application data through

00:01:02.080 --> 00:01:04.035
the approved maintenance procedure.

00:01:04.256 --> 00:01:06.709
Keep verified copies outside the appliance.

00:01:06.874 --> 00:01:11.389
Preserve credentials, pipelines, approval records and recovery progress

00:01:11.567 --> 00:01:15.883
together. Do not use unrelated backup halves as a restore pair.

00:01:16.217 --> 00:01:20.868
For support, record the running image and health build identity, relevant job

00:01:20.868 --> 00:01:23.377
identifiers and safe audit evidence.

00:01:23.769 --> 00:01:26.821
A downloaded update is not an installed update.

00:01:27.031 --> 00:01:31.596
Keep passwords, private keys and customer details out of screenshots and exported

00:01:31.596 --> 00:01:36.184
diagnostics. Use the current written guide for the version-specific procedure.
